Package: photo-batch-renamer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libxcb-cursor0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbcommon0, libegl1, libgl1, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, libglib2.0-0
Maintainer: kalatyn <kalatyn@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/kalatyn/photo-batch-renamer
Description: Rename all photos in a folder to "Name_1", "Name_2", ...
 Simple desktop app for photographers: pick a folder, type a name
 (for example "Mexico 2016") and every photo gets a clear, numbered name.
 Live preview, sorting by EXIF date taken, undo.
